{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_04_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e3b6304f56e20142af847b60eb087c50d3a9b8dcc7d4937fc3c49e76b470ed0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dff9f2ee64c04f82374428f0dd6aec579e0111a9adce10c29ba9afa13c92eaf",
      "text": "……总而言之，大海拥有着接纳\n我们好奇心的，深邃的魅力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6327bbfa4fdcb28fc7cd2295fb63b8d2be634ce307f9bafa1ba12c615e9979da",
      "text": "……是的，无论我讲了多少次课，\n都无法引起学生们的兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab6c18c21e57afd5b7af2dd0a6c13a093ffa6de8280e9775107f5607b8488a97",
      "text": "但是，如果借助偶像这个全新的世界、全新的手段……\n一定能够，传达给更多的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe5d12b5aa4fd91267d4cd18fbca71b550ed92012e79fb37fd7fdc250962c1f2",
      "text": "能够增加热爱大海的同志……！\n我是这么想的，才参加了这场试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39bc72d7b62e8bd037be7dad191cd3120697da7eaa800913c10bf9cee0734717",
      "text": "（多么富有热情啊。\n畅谈喜爱之物的他，真是充满魅力！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff575e9739cfb29427a4dc8a8fd0208761796fc572204d2a6b6cfa7458b6bdcb",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么接下来，请北村想乐先生开始。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afca05880b5bb45901bd672abe21483fffa9028ed3727709bdbb934bbefb7c4b",
      "text": "我是北村想乐。\n一边上大学，一边在杂货店当兼职店员～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d47b268ab6a2656d2f3705282d4db65eba02ae0e7a9eb01b06b32e37e7ad1d38",
      "text": "请问您对这个世界产生兴趣的理由是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55bb2513e68d992a43c33cdf9851aa4f9b67f55e15a7f6f01d773c8534055316",
      "text": "（……这种问题，像那个人那样\n热情洋溢地回答好像更能博得好感呢～……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7508c3af5a8f7173633ad7b3f54839ffbf05980882268af40add1bec1dffb47",
      "text": "（但我，是为了展现真实的自己、\n想要自由地生活才来这里的呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
